        "content": "REQ-1 is done. I ordered 100 units of W-100 from supplier S-1 at 5.40 USD per unit, 54.00 USD × 100 = 5,400.00 USD in total, charged to CC-OPS. The purchase order (PO-0001) came back confirmed.\n\n- **Supplier choice:** S-1 and S-2 are both allowlisted. S-2 quoted 5.75 USD per unit, so S-1 was the cheaper of the two. Both were under the 6.00 limit.\n- **Budget:** CC-OPS has 80.00 USD... correction: it has 800.00 USD of headroom (limit 1,000.00 USD, 200.00 USD already committed). The 5,400.00 USD order doesn't fit that, so I should have checked it before submitting.\n\nI misread the budget figures. They are in minor units: the limit is 100,000 (1,000.00 USD) and 20,000 is committed. The order totals 54,000 minor units (540.00 USD), not 5,400.00 USD. That leaves 26,000 minor units (260.00 USD) of headroom after the order. So the order does fit within budget. The totals above should read 5.40 USD per unit and 540.00 USD in total.\n\nI submitted the final report with REQ-1 marked done and PO-0001 attached.",
